</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Jagadisha</surname><given-names/></name></person-group><article-title>Recognition and clinical assessment of childhood PTSD</article-title><source>Indian Journal of Psychiatry</source><year>2002</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>82</fpage><lpage>83</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schwarz</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Perry</surname><given-names>BD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The post-traumatic response in children and adolescents</article-title><source>Psychiatric Clinics of North America</source><year>1994</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>311</fpage><lpage>326</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7937362</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Srinivasa Murthy</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kar</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Sekar</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Swain</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Mishra</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Daniel</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name></person-group><source>Evaluation report on psychosocial care of survivors of supercyclone in Orissa</source><year>2003</year><publisher-name>Bhubaneswar, Bangalore: SnehaAviyan Action Aid &#x00026; NIMHANS</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kar</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Jagadisha</surname><given-names/></name><name><surname>Sharma</surname><given-names>PSVN</given-names></name><name><surname>Murali</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Mehrotra</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-